  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the governance and economics of protected areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proejct aims to develop a Southern African community of practice in pro-poor natural resource governance, education, research and application at regional higher education institutions in Zambia and the SADC region.</narrative>
  </description>
